        "message": "G1.33, G1.34 Done: PLT-02/PLT-03 Proven; the seeded example's time is real (D17); no report during a reset (CR-67)\n\nG1.33 follow-up from its R2 checkpoint (D_Reviews/DB_test_review/20261015_\nG1.33_risk.md, 0 Critical/High, TR-87 closed, PLT-02 and PLT-03 Proven):\nTR-94 - the self-test's run() now makes the child write UTF-8, so the command\nPart 0 documents no longer crashes on Windows (a regression this row made);\nTR-95 - the \"snapshotted rename\" cases commit the snapshot first and assert\nthe rename was really checked, for a snapshot named for either end.\nSelf-test 37 checks.\n\nG1.34 (D17 (a), CR-67): seed_previous_report no longer shapes generated_at,\nso the seeded reconciliation line is true; report_service.generate answers\n409 while the reset lock is held. Both tests failed first. R2 (D_Reviews/\nDB_test_review/20261015_G1.34_risk.md): 0 Critical/High; REG-16, REG-17,\nGEN-04 Proven; TR-113 fixed (test retagged REG-16).\n\nHeld for the gate triage: TR-96..99, TR-110..112, TR-114.\nBackend 253 pass / 4 skip; frontend green.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
